It's the PAL code that's different.   With SRM the PAL code that the kernel
hooks to is part of the SRM firmware. With AlphaBios, the PAL code is
encoded into the MILO loader, "but" it is not the most recent code, but the
stuff from the old OEM SRM developers kit, used to write code for the old
eval alpha boards from Digital.. Primitive but it works ok for 2.2 kernels.

JJ

